= The mandate meets its record

Lewica entered the term as **[+ opposition_2023_strategy +]**. The cabinet has
now supplied enough votes, appointments and missed dates to test whether that
line produces leverage or merely describes the party to itself.

The review may deepen the mandate or replace it. Changing direction preserves
the opposition role; it does not create a confidence agreement.

- @review_social
- @review_watchdog
- @review_broker

