= One ballot does not settle the parliamentary term

Campaign cooperation created photographs, shared voters and debts. None of it
automatically binds Lewica to the cabinet's bills. The party must decide which
part of the presidential coalition, if any, survives in Parliament.

- @presidential_independent
- @presidential_democratic_floor
- @presidential_scrutiny

