= Opposition must end in an offer

Hearings, amendments and demonstrations have produced a record. The convention
must now say what Lewica would do with executive authority, and whom it would
ask to carry that programme through the Sejm.

- @convention_social_contract
- @convention_shadow_team
- @convention_legislative_pact

